flowchart LR
  VIN[ESP32 VIN] --> VCC[HC-SR04 VCC]
  GND[ESP32 GND] --> HGND[HC-SR04 GND]
  D18[ESP32 GPIO18] --> TRIG[HC-SR04 TRIG]
  ECHO[HC-SR04 ECHO] --> R1[1k ohm]
  R1 --> MID[Row 24 midpoint]
  MID --> D19[ESP32 GPIO19]
  MID --> R2[2k ohm]
  R2 --> GND

  D21[ESP32 GPIO21] --> RLED[220 ohm]
  RLED --> LED[Red LED]
  LED --> GND

  VIN --> SRED[Servo red]
  GND --> SBROWN[Servo brown]
  D22[ESP32 GPIO22] --> SORANGE[Servo orange]
